"It doesn't answer. It testifies."

This standard is published so the governed-agent-kernel category — deny-by-default,
fail-closed, audit-chained, tamper-evident, bounded, honest, contained — can be
tested, not asserted. Any kernel that passes the clause set may claim the
GAK-conformant mark, including kernels unaffiliated with Centennial Defense
Systems. This published standard is and will remain Apache-2.0; the grant on
